### Telegram Bot Story Command
# @name getWebhook
GET https://first-bot-production.up.railway.app/api/telegram/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Story API endpoints
# @name getAllStories
GET https://first-bot-production.up.railway.app/api/stories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get story by ID
# @name getStoryById
GET https://first-bot-production.up.railway.app/api/stories/64f23e2b6a6e982a4fb66a2c
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get stories by date
# @name getStoriesByDate
GET https://first-bot-production.up.railway.app/api/stories/date/2023-09-01
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get recent stories
# @name getRecentStories
GET https://first-bot-production.up.railway.app/api/stories/recent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

